WEBVTT

01:30.950 --> 01:34.979
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.060 --> 01:37.920
[Episode 14]

01:39.430 --> 01:40.150
Sir.

01:41.280 --> 01:43.759
When I went to the military camp
to rescue her,

01:43.759 --> 01:44.509
I had already thought of

01:44.509 --> 01:45.910
all 3 possible outcomes,

01:47.120 --> 01:48.920
including this second situation

01:48.920 --> 01:49.950
you mentioned.

01:51.000 --> 01:52.259
Here's what I thought:

01:53.560 --> 01:54.420
as long as Yimei

01:54.430 --> 01:55.630
could return safely,

01:56.640 --> 01:57.870
she would still be your daughter

01:57.870 --> 01:59.560
and still be my wife.

02:01.790 --> 02:02.990
Being able to survive

02:03.000 --> 02:04.260
in these chaotic times

02:04.790 --> 02:06.450
is already difficult enough.

02:07.040 --> 02:09.470
To pursue accountability
for those things any further

02:09.470 --> 02:10.530
would be too cruel.

02:13.630 --> 02:15.800
You see, I'm a condemned official
of the imperial court myself,

02:15.800 --> 02:17.660
someone who fled back from exile.

02:18.680 --> 02:21.079
If others start asking questions about me,

02:21.120 --> 02:21.780
how is Yimei

02:22.170 --> 02:23.590
supposed to face them?

02:26.360 --> 02:27.079
Sir,

02:28.000 --> 02:31.150
I've always kept these thoughts to myself.

02:32.150 --> 02:35.480
I only dared to say these out loud today
because you asked me.

02:36.430 --> 02:37.829
If, by any chance, Yimei…

02:41.079 --> 02:41.870
I hope

02:42.810 --> 02:44.210
you can keep an open heart

02:45.040 --> 02:46.290
and never blame her.

02:47.660 --> 02:49.260
None of it would be her fault.

03:03.900 --> 03:05.240
The wind is a bit strong.

03:05.840 --> 03:07.670
It's making my eyes sting.

03:23.030 --> 03:25.430
Before the merciful Guanyin Bodhisattva,

03:25.620 --> 03:28.079
I, Bai Yimei, make this sincere prayer:

03:29.079 --> 03:31.079
may the villagers of Shanjian Village

03:31.079 --> 03:32.740
be spared from all suffering,

03:33.480 --> 03:35.010
may there be no more famine,

03:36.030 --> 03:38.230
and may the tea plantation be restored.

03:39.910 --> 03:43.170
Please bless the entire village
with happiness and peace.

03:47.810 --> 03:50.750
I pray that my father remains healthy

03:52.110 --> 03:53.710
and protected from all harm,

03:55.350 --> 03:56.980
and that Mrs. Gu and Pingyuan

03:57.590 --> 03:59.250
may reunite as mother and son,

03:59.370 --> 04:00.970
never to be separated again,

04:01.750 --> 04:03.680
and may all their wishes come true.

04:09.800 --> 04:10.430
Here.

04:10.870 --> 04:13.150
You're breaking the rules
by bringing this here.

04:13.150 --> 04:14.060
Put it away

04:14.280 --> 04:15.810
before anyone else sees it.

04:20.550 --> 04:23.010
Every night,
when your pain was at its worst,

04:23.290 --> 04:26.360
I was here chanting sutras for you
to ease your suffering.

04:26.360 --> 04:28.360
The Bodhisattva is merciful
and compassionate.

04:28.360 --> 04:30.560
She responds to all who earnestly pray.

04:31.680 --> 04:33.610
My injuries are mostly healed now.

04:34.560 --> 04:36.620
What are you still praying to her for?

04:39.270 --> 04:41.800
I'm praying that you can become
a good person.

04:49.870 --> 04:50.680
A good person?

04:56.270 --> 04:58.670
Back when we fought
in Huzhou and Hangzhou,

04:59.240 --> 05:01.370
I was already the commanding general.

05:02.390 --> 05:04.130
I can't even count

05:05.560 --> 05:07.690
how many people died by my hand myself.

05:10.870 --> 05:12.600
The Bodhisattva won't save me.

05:14.920 --> 05:15.800
But I will.

05:18.190 --> 05:19.070
I will.

05:22.240 --> 05:23.160
I will.

05:35.950 --> 05:37.000
If someone else

05:37.920 --> 05:39.120
is about to be harmed,

05:40.350 --> 05:43.210
and they call upon the name
of Guanyin Bodhisattva…

06:35.070 --> 06:35.630
Go.

06:35.960 --> 06:37.120
Open all those crates

06:37.120 --> 06:37.980
in that corner.

06:38.000 --> 06:38.390
Yes.

06:57.720 --> 06:58.580
Come in with me.

07:05.720 --> 07:06.560
Take a look.

07:08.270 --> 07:10.510
See if there's anything among
all these treasures and jewelry

07:10.510 --> 07:11.970
in this room that you like.

07:12.040 --> 07:13.770
You can take whatever you want.

07:14.000 --> 07:14.870
So many?

07:15.190 --> 07:15.830
Of course.

07:17.030 --> 07:19.220
Waging war costs money.

07:19.480 --> 07:20.510
I can't let my soldiers

07:20.510 --> 07:21.510
live on air, can I?

07:22.930 --> 07:23.920
Enough talk.

07:24.070 --> 07:25.530
Hurry and pick something.

07:26.680 --> 07:27.940
I don't want anything.

07:28.070 --> 07:28.670
You don't?

07:29.720 --> 07:31.580
But these are all valuable items.

07:40.630 --> 07:41.490
Check this out.

07:42.120 --> 07:43.320
Beautiful, isn't it?

07:43.680 --> 07:44.560
Keep it safe.

07:45.120 --> 07:46.430
You might find it useful one day

07:46.430 --> 07:47.630
when you get married.

07:55.630 --> 07:56.600
It's so pretty.

07:58.180 --> 08:00.040
I'll pick a few more items for you.

08:07.510 --> 08:08.810
Where did this come from?

08:08.810 --> 08:09.870
Does it matter?

08:09.920 --> 08:10.650
Just keep it.

08:11.660 --> 08:12.950
The person who used to wear this headdress

08:12.950 --> 08:14.190
must have been very beautiful,

08:14.190 --> 08:15.040
or else she wouldn't deserve

08:15.040 --> 08:16.440
such exquisite jewelry.

08:17.560 --> 08:18.800
Is she dead,

08:19.480 --> 08:20.640
or did she escape?

08:22.000 --> 08:23.120
Was she buried,

08:23.190 --> 08:24.990
or were her remains never found?

08:26.950 --> 08:28.430
I really don't know
whether the owner of this

08:28.430 --> 08:29.360
is dead or alive.

08:29.800 --> 08:31.600
All these treasures in this room

08:31.720 --> 08:33.169
were originally taken from
the common people

08:33.169 --> 08:34.510
by corrupt officials,

08:34.870 --> 08:36.200
and I confiscated them.

08:37.270 --> 08:38.130
Just take them.

08:38.720 --> 08:40.590
You can certainly give me a gift,

08:41.000 --> 08:42.860
as long as it truly belongs to you.

08:44.600 --> 08:45.400
Belongs to me?

08:49.030 --> 08:50.320
All I have left is this last breath,

08:50.320 --> 08:51.120
this one life—

08:51.510 --> 08:52.570
and I still need it

08:52.630 --> 08:53.700
to lead my troops.

08:56.150 --> 08:57.880
Just take it as doing me a favor.

08:58.840 --> 09:00.870
If I cannot repay you for saving my life,

09:00.870 --> 09:02.130
I would die in anguish.

09:02.910 --> 09:03.390
Here.

09:03.510 --> 09:05.110
If you truly want to repay me,

09:05.150 --> 09:06.910
you need to take better care of yourself.

09:06.910 --> 09:07.720
This life of yours—

09:07.720 --> 09:09.530
I worked day and night to save it.

09:09.720 --> 09:11.170
Even if there were
mountains of gold and silver here,

09:11.170 --> 09:13.570
could any of it be worth
more than your life?

09:15.240 --> 09:16.630
After you're fully healed,

09:16.630 --> 09:17.510
take me back,

09:17.740 --> 09:18.980
and we'll be even.

09:33.750 --> 09:35.500
I'll send you back today.

09:40.940 --> 09:42.140
We're breaking camp.

09:47.120 --> 09:47.910
Where to?

09:50.360 --> 09:51.290
To attack Hefei.

10:10.270 --> 10:11.040
In a while,

10:11.670 --> 10:13.250
follow this mountain path

10:13.550 --> 10:14.490
westward

10:14.670 --> 10:15.720
and ride for 40 li.

10:17.120 --> 10:17.960
I know the way.

10:20.270 --> 10:21.270
After you return,

10:21.720 --> 10:22.510
don't speak of anything

10:22.510 --> 10:23.910
that happened in my camp,

10:24.000 --> 10:25.330
and especially don't tell anyone

10:25.330 --> 10:26.860
that you treated my wounds.

10:27.440 --> 10:29.240
Otherwise, the authorities will accuse you
of aiding the enemy,

10:29.240 --> 10:30.980
and who knows what nonsense

10:31.550 --> 10:35.150
those simple‑minded villagers
of yours might make up about you.

10:35.270 --> 10:36.650
I'm not a child.

10:37.040 --> 10:38.840
You don't have to worry about me.

10:40.120 --> 10:40.910
Alright.

10:42.720 --> 10:43.830
I have a request.

10:44.290 --> 10:45.150
Will you agree?

10:47.750 --> 10:48.350
What is it?

10:48.940 --> 10:50.150
Still want me to become some good person

10:50.150 --> 10:51.480
who cherishes his life?

11:05.280 --> 11:05.940
Put this on.

11:14.660 --> 11:16.240
This was left to me by my mother.

11:16.240 --> 11:18.700
I hold it day and night
to pray for blessings,

11:19.100 --> 11:20.830
and I never let it leave my side.

11:29.960 --> 11:30.630
It's just a pity

11:30.630 --> 11:32.550
that there's too much blood on my hands.

11:32.550 --> 11:33.750
Even if I wear it,

11:34.480 --> 11:35.810
I'm still going to hell.

11:37.990 --> 11:38.870
Then I'll go

11:39.030 --> 11:40.440
visit you in hell.

12:21.080 --> 12:21.680
Pingyuan!

12:22.120 --> 12:22.720
Pingyuan!

12:23.480 --> 12:24.510
What's wrong? Why are you running?

12:24.510 --> 12:25.970
Is there a dog chasing you?

12:26.550 --> 12:26.960
Bai...

12:27.720 --> 12:29.050
Miss Bai is back!

12:30.080 --> 12:31.740
Miss Bai is back!

12:35.600 --> 12:37.800
It's Miss Bai! She's back!

12:46.910 --> 12:47.670
Auntie.

12:51.620 --> 12:52.550
Sister-in-law.

12:58.120 --> 12:58.670
Mr. Xu.

13:12.200 --> 13:13.100
I'm back.

13:19.870 --> 13:20.510
Yimei!

13:26.080 --> 13:26.570
Father.

13:27.600 --> 13:28.730
-Father!
-My child!

13:29.080 --> 13:29.550
Father!

13:36.480 --> 13:37.030
Father.

13:42.510 --> 13:43.240
Father.

13:46.750 --> 13:47.410
Father.

13:54.850 --> 13:55.450
Yimei.

13:57.910 --> 13:59.040
It's windy out here.

13:59.060 --> 14:00.120
Let's talk inside.

14:01.240 --> 14:02.020
Let's go home.

14:02.020 --> 14:02.590
Okay.

14:03.080 --> 14:03.610
Let's go.

14:04.390 --> 14:05.190
Let's go home.

14:19.160 --> 14:20.610
You can't delay this matter any longer.

14:19.260 --> 14:23.480
[Blessings and Auspiciousness]

14:20.670 --> 14:22.390
Just call off the wedding right away.

14:22.390 --> 14:22.910
Besides,

14:22.910 --> 14:24.490
Pingwen's not married yet.

14:24.600 --> 14:25.330
Right.

14:25.440 --> 14:25.910
Don't end up

14:25.910 --> 14:27.120
dragging all of us down with you.

14:27.120 --> 14:27.790
Besides, Pingyuan

14:27.790 --> 14:28.360
can't afford to

14:28.360 --> 14:29.390
be arrested by the government again.

14:29.390 --> 14:30.080
He's here.

14:40.080 --> 14:40.720
Go find out

14:40.750 --> 14:42.270
what people are saying outside.

14:42.270 --> 14:42.670
Hurry.

14:42.720 --> 14:43.080
Yes.

14:51.760 --> 14:53.020
Miss Bai is back?

14:54.490 --> 14:55.960
You already heard, Mother?

14:55.960 --> 14:56.570
I was just about to

14:56.570 --> 14:58.230
share this good news with you.

15:00.840 --> 15:02.640
Mrs. Li and the others

15:03.030 --> 15:05.160
came over just now and told me about it.

15:06.030 --> 15:07.030
What did they say?

15:10.240 --> 15:11.170
They said she...

15:13.790 --> 15:14.600
That she...

15:16.030 --> 15:17.030
What did they say?

15:17.080 --> 15:18.280
Why are you like this?

15:18.320 --> 15:19.080
So fierce.

15:23.600 --> 15:24.120
Mother.

15:25.640 --> 15:27.870
This time, it was only because
Yimei risked her life

15:27.870 --> 15:29.600
to treat that commanding general

15:29.600 --> 15:30.510
that all the women in our village

15:30.510 --> 15:31.710
got to return safely.

15:33.750 --> 15:34.790
But just now,

15:35.550 --> 15:36.670
I noticed the looks
on those people's faces—

15:36.670 --> 15:38.120
they didn't seem friendly.

15:38.120 --> 15:39.720
So I wondered what they said.

15:41.270 --> 15:42.440
They said she

15:44.550 --> 15:45.610
submitted herself

15:46.480 --> 15:48.080
to the Southern Army's commanding general,

15:48.080 --> 15:50.600
and that she might have come back
to take her father south

15:50.600 --> 15:52.080
to enjoy a better life.

15:57.200 --> 15:58.480
Were you even raised by humans?

15:58.480 --> 15:59.720
What are you doing?

15:59.750 --> 16:01.610
Are you trying to eat someone now?

16:06.200 --> 16:07.260
It's not like that.

16:07.270 --> 16:08.470
Mother, listen to me.

16:10.510 --> 16:11.240
That commanding general

16:11.240 --> 16:13.240
was just one breath away from dying.

16:14.030 --> 16:15.510
If Yimei hadn't saved him,

16:16.230 --> 16:19.290
all the women in our village
would have been massacred.

16:19.440 --> 16:20.240
That man was already injured

16:20.240 --> 16:20.840
so badly

16:21.200 --> 16:23.550
that even healing him
would be a waste of medicine.

16:23.550 --> 16:25.080
What could he possibly do
after he woke up?

16:25.080 --> 16:27.880
How could they say
she "submitted herself" to him?

16:30.790 --> 16:32.910
And all that talk about
running off to the south.

16:32.910 --> 16:34.370
Those despicable people,

16:34.870 --> 16:35.600
I wish I could just…

16:35.600 --> 16:36.730
Wish you could what?

16:37.480 --> 16:38.730
Kill them?

16:39.150 --> 16:40.980
Are you the same as they are?

16:41.120 --> 16:41.440
No.

16:41.480 --> 16:43.480
But Mother, you have to trust Yimei.

16:45.030 --> 16:47.030
Yimei waited for me all these years.

16:47.030 --> 16:48.910
She's such a gentle, fragile woman,

16:48.910 --> 16:51.240
yet she stepped forward to save everyone.

16:51.960 --> 16:54.020
If that's not a heart of gold, what is?

16:54.440 --> 16:55.390
All right.

16:56.550 --> 16:57.570
All right.

16:59.200 --> 17:00.480
But let me ask you this:

17:00.940 --> 17:02.500
if the government sends people here

17:02.500 --> 17:04.140
and they start asking questions,

17:04.140 --> 17:06.010
do you think they'll believe it?

17:07.240 --> 17:08.310
What if they accuse her of
aiding the enemy?

17:08.310 --> 17:09.109
What then?

17:09.829 --> 17:10.359
Those...

17:10.510 --> 17:11.500
Those soldiers

17:11.589 --> 17:12.400
don't care about

17:12.400 --> 17:13.400
mercy or compassion.

17:13.400 --> 17:15.599
They'll just grab onto her and kill her.

17:22.310 --> 17:22.960
Son,

17:24.480 --> 17:25.640
if you trust her,

17:27.030 --> 17:28.190
then take

17:29.030 --> 17:30.440
Yimei and Mr. Bai

17:30.480 --> 17:32.140
and leave as soon as possible.

17:35.790 --> 17:36.450
I won't go.

17:39.400 --> 17:40.730
I'm not going anywhere.

17:44.560 --> 17:45.750
I've finally made it back home.

17:45.750 --> 17:46.310
Mother,

17:56.360 --> 17:59.020
I don't want to leave your side
even for a moment.

18:01.160 --> 18:03.060
I'm a person, not a tree.

18:04.680 --> 18:06.880
I don't want to be moved around anymore.

18:11.480 --> 18:12.140
Who's that?

18:12.160 --> 18:13.650
Pingwen got into a fight!

18:32.000 --> 18:32.920
Hit him! Hit him!

18:32.920 --> 18:34.240
Two against one, shameless!

18:34.240 --> 18:35.000
Chop him up!

18:35.640 --> 18:36.110
Go away!

18:38.880 --> 18:39.340
Stop it!

18:42.640 --> 18:43.230
Stop it!

18:45.270 --> 18:46.070
Get back here!

18:46.640 --> 18:47.440
Get back here!

18:48.270 --> 18:49.270
Come beat him up with me,

18:49.270 --> 18:49.870
Pingyuan.

18:50.920 --> 18:52.650
Listen to what they're saying!

18:52.680 --> 18:53.240
So what?

18:53.400 --> 18:54.860
Say that again if you dare!

18:57.380 --> 18:59.310
If they don't want to say it, leave it.

18:59.310 --> 18:59.970
You tell me.

19:00.950 --> 19:01.770
They said

19:02.030 --> 19:04.070
Miss Bai and that commanding general
had an affair.

19:04.070 --> 19:05.180
You filthy-mouthed bastard!

19:05.180 --> 19:05.980
Did you see it?

19:06.000 --> 19:07.260
She was alone in the military camp.

19:07.260 --> 19:08.660
Who knows what happened?

19:09.110 --> 19:09.720
You should go back

19:09.720 --> 19:10.850
and ask your own wife

19:11.350 --> 19:12.790
how she managed to come back.

19:12.790 --> 19:13.350
In the military camp,

19:13.350 --> 19:14.030
if Bai Yimei

19:14.030 --> 19:15.830
hadn't treated that commanding general,

19:15.830 --> 19:17.690
none of them would have returned.

19:19.110 --> 19:20.710
Each of you is big and strong,

19:21.550 --> 19:22.590
but where were you

19:22.610 --> 19:23.850
when your wives were being kidnapped?

19:23.850 --> 19:25.440
Did a single one of you
dare to step forward,

19:25.440 --> 19:27.100
even just to try and stop them?

19:28.120 --> 19:29.280
And now you gossip

19:29.960 --> 19:31.090
behind their backs,

19:31.830 --> 19:33.560
slandering an innocent woman?

19:34.030 --> 19:35.360
What kind of men are you?

19:37.030 --> 19:37.560
Let's go.

19:39.030 --> 19:40.000
I'll beat you so bad

19:40.000 --> 19:40.960
that even your own mother
won't recognize you!

19:40.960 --> 19:43.440
She treated his wounds. How could there
possibly be nothing between them?

19:43.440 --> 19:43.920
Tell me.

19:44.240 --> 19:45.200
Just like when there's meat
right in front of you,

19:45.200 --> 19:47.260
which one of you wouldn't take a bite?

19:52.310 --> 19:52.940
I dare you to say that again!

19:52.940 --> 19:53.590
Let's go. Let's go.

19:53.590 --> 19:54.420
Pingyuan! Pingyuan!

19:54.420 --> 19:55.350
Pingyuan! Pingyuan!

19:55.350 --> 19:57.110
We can't afford to get involved in
a case where someone might die.

19:57.110 --> 19:57.590
You're not like me.

19:57.590 --> 20:00.650
Y-You don't know your own strength
when you hit people.

20:15.880 --> 20:16.640
Daughter,

20:17.400 --> 20:18.440
eat something.

20:20.270 --> 20:21.110
Open the door.

20:31.470 --> 20:34.530
If you listen to all that gossip,
where does it ever end?

20:35.750 --> 20:37.590
That's just how people are.

20:39.070 --> 20:41.270
No one's even running this country now,

20:41.720 --> 20:44.160
so who's going to bother
asking about your little issues?

20:44.160 --> 20:45.290
Just eat something.

20:45.400 --> 20:46.640
Don't make me worry.

20:48.640 --> 20:49.240
Be good.

20:50.950 --> 20:51.570
Sir.

20:55.920 --> 20:56.480
Wait.

20:56.510 --> 20:57.110
You two brothers

20:57.110 --> 20:59.440
look like you just came off a battlefield.

20:59.550 --> 21:00.280
Wait, you...

21:01.560 --> 21:03.760
Sir, my mother requests your presence.

21:03.960 --> 21:05.890
My mother requests your presence.

21:06.200 --> 21:07.600
I'll be there in a minute.

21:08.640 --> 21:09.170
Pingwen.

21:09.640 --> 21:10.240
Come here.

21:10.640 --> 21:11.290
Help me up.

21:11.350 --> 21:12.210
Let me help you.

21:26.710 --> 21:27.770
She won't come out.

21:29.440 --> 21:30.770
Keep an eye on her for me.

21:31.440 --> 21:33.100
Don't let her commit suicide.

21:35.310 --> 21:36.040
Understood.

21:39.830 --> 21:40.460
Pingwen.

21:41.350 --> 21:41.880
Let's go.

21:52.830 --> 21:53.530
Yimei.

21:55.510 --> 21:56.210
Yimei!

21:57.000 --> 21:58.010
Open the door.

22:00.110 --> 22:02.400
Do you really want to
break your father's heart?

22:02.400 --> 22:03.660
We can talk things out.

22:03.830 --> 22:04.960
Why shut the door?

22:05.790 --> 22:06.400
Yimei!

22:21.000 --> 22:21.640
I know

22:22.110 --> 22:23.510
you feel upset right now.

22:25.550 --> 22:26.150
Talk to me.

22:27.550 --> 22:28.410
I'm listening.

22:29.960 --> 22:31.490
What's there to talk about?

22:31.640 --> 22:32.790
No one will believe me.

22:32.790 --> 22:33.600
I will.

22:34.510 --> 22:35.310
I believe you.

22:37.200 --> 22:39.600
I've seen with my own eyes
how brave you are.

22:39.860 --> 22:40.440
Yimei.

22:41.440 --> 22:42.000
Between us,

22:42.000 --> 22:44.310
there's no need to ask
whether I believe you or not.

22:44.310 --> 22:45.880
If I had known things would
turn out like this,

22:45.880 --> 22:48.680
I might as well have just died
in the military camp.

22:49.310 --> 22:50.440
Don't say things out of anger.

22:50.440 --> 22:51.750
I'm not saying it out of anger.

22:51.750 --> 22:53.290
What is it then?

22:54.200 --> 22:55.000
Let me ask you.

22:55.640 --> 22:57.170
If you had the chance again,

22:57.550 --> 22:58.240
would you

22:58.240 --> 23:00.040
still step forward to save them?

23:00.720 --> 23:02.050
In these chaotic times,

23:02.150 --> 23:03.350
since when has saving people

23:03.350 --> 23:05.020
ever come with the expectation
of getting anything in return?

23:05.020 --> 23:06.480
Would you stop saving them

23:06.680 --> 23:08.940
just because they don't appreciate you?

23:12.750 --> 23:13.510
I know.

23:14.790 --> 23:16.290
But I'm just so angry.

23:18.480 --> 23:19.280
I understand.

23:21.000 --> 23:22.310
Human hearts can be so cruel

23:22.310 --> 23:24.110
that even dogs won't touch them.

23:24.350 --> 23:25.270
Back in Ningguta,

23:25.270 --> 23:26.000
I thought

23:26.440 --> 23:29.030
everything would be fine
if I could just get out.

23:29.030 --> 23:30.760
But only after coming back here

23:31.310 --> 23:33.170
did I realize life is even harder.

23:33.920 --> 23:34.830
Compared to those

23:34.830 --> 23:36.230
passionate men in exile,

23:36.830 --> 23:37.890
the people here...

23:50.550 --> 23:51.420
Gu.

23:53.070 --> 23:54.600
I haven't even asked you yet

23:55.420 --> 23:56.860
how your years

23:56.890 --> 23:57.910
in exile were,

23:58.750 --> 24:00.950
and here you are, asking about me first.

24:01.980 --> 24:04.180
How could they possibly have been good?

24:04.550 --> 24:05.950
In my first year of exile,

24:06.070 --> 24:07.470
I was sent to pan for gold.

24:08.440 --> 24:10.640
The ice on the river hadn't even melted,

24:10.750 --> 24:12.230
and when I put my feet in,

24:13.000 --> 24:14.280
it felt like 10,000 needles

24:14.280 --> 24:15.880
piercing the tops of my feet.

24:16.350 --> 24:17.550
That feeling was like

24:18.000 --> 24:19.660
dying and coming back to life.

24:20.720 --> 24:22.250
But I always had one belief.

24:23.200 --> 24:24.200
I told myself

24:24.200 --> 24:25.930
that as long as I'm still alive,

24:26.070 --> 24:26.750
I'd have a chance

24:26.750 --> 24:27.880
to see you all again.

24:29.680 --> 24:31.080
You've suffered so much.

24:31.960 --> 24:32.510
Yimei.

24:33.790 --> 24:35.250
Staying alive isn't easy,

24:36.100 --> 24:37.960
and meeting again is even harder.

24:39.270 --> 24:40.610
Your father just told me

24:41.030 --> 24:43.360
he's worried you might take your own life.

24:43.440 --> 24:45.790
Do you know during these days
you were taken away,

24:45.790 --> 24:46.680
he practically lost half his life

24:46.680 --> 24:47.880
from the worry?

24:48.720 --> 24:51.030
Now that you're back, are you going to
keep making him worry?

24:51.030 --> 24:53.960
Do you really not care about
his well-being anymore?

24:56.880 --> 24:57.880
I understand now.

24:59.510 --> 25:00.920
I was being childish.

25:06.680 --> 25:07.160
Yimei.

25:09.000 --> 25:10.190
Back there,

25:11.310 --> 25:12.070
I often lay alone

25:12.070 --> 25:13.110
in the snow,

25:13.550 --> 25:14.950
watching the snowflakes

25:14.960 --> 25:15.960
slowly covering me

25:15.960 --> 25:16.960
like a blanket.

25:18.350 --> 25:19.680
I would look up at the sky

25:21.960 --> 25:22.750
and wonder,

25:23.790 --> 25:25.510
under this same sky,

25:25.960 --> 25:27.290
what were you all doing?

25:30.590 --> 25:31.400
Perhaps

25:32.310 --> 25:33.640
you were already awake,

25:34.790 --> 25:35.650
boiling water,

25:37.110 --> 25:38.970
preparing to make tea for Mr. Bai.

25:41.310 --> 25:42.750
Perhaps those children

25:43.440 --> 25:45.700
were noisily arriving at the classroom,

25:46.240 --> 25:47.960
and you had to tap each of them
on the head

25:47.960 --> 25:49.550
with your little pointer

25:49.750 --> 25:52.680
before they'd settle down
and recite their lessons.

25:52.750 --> 25:53.590
Gu...

25:54.400 --> 25:55.000
Yimei.

26:10.790 --> 26:11.670
Gu.

26:14.200 --> 26:16.000
I won't upset my father anymore.

26:18.350 --> 26:20.950
I need some time alone
to think things through.

26:21.680 --> 26:23.410
There's just too much going on.

26:23.960 --> 26:25.510
I-I'm going to rest now.

26:55.200 --> 26:56.030
In-law.

26:57.240 --> 26:59.030
Rumors cut like knives.

27:00.920 --> 27:03.200
I fear my daughter has been torn apart.

27:04.790 --> 27:06.590
I tried to persuade him just now.

27:08.000 --> 27:09.120
I told him to take

27:09.690 --> 27:11.800
you and Yimei

27:11.960 --> 27:13.790
and run far away from here,

27:14.510 --> 27:15.940
but he actually refused.

27:16.880 --> 27:18.480
I'm at my wit's end.

27:19.680 --> 27:21.140
Please try talking to him.

27:24.070 --> 27:26.660
I can talk to him,
but who's going to talk to me?

27:27.400 --> 27:29.080
Besides, even if we run away,

27:29.110 --> 27:30.510
what about you and Pingwen?

27:30.510 --> 27:31.300
You would certainly

27:31.300 --> 27:33.020
be implicated.

27:34.110 --> 27:35.000
If we all leave,

27:35.030 --> 27:36.350
our ancestors' graves are still here,

27:36.350 --> 27:37.000
our land is still here,

27:37.000 --> 27:37.830
and our tea plantation is still here—

27:37.830 --> 27:39.240
who will take care of them?

27:39.240 --> 27:40.550
Even if we escape,

27:40.790 --> 27:42.780
where could we possibly settle?

27:42.920 --> 27:44.100
Do you expect me, at my age,

27:44.100 --> 27:47.100
to make a living
by kneeling on the ground and begging?

27:51.660 --> 27:55.310
[Blessings and Auspiciousness]

27:53.880 --> 27:55.260
Mother, Mr. Bai.

27:55.400 --> 27:56.000
Pingwen,

27:56.920 --> 27:58.120
go boil some water

27:58.350 --> 27:59.890
to make tea for Mr. Bai.

28:05.720 --> 28:06.340
Pingyuan.

28:07.920 --> 28:10.160
I've just been discussing with Mr. Bai

28:10.720 --> 28:12.550
and want to hear your thoughts.

28:13.000 --> 28:14.330
My thoughts about what?

28:21.440 --> 28:21.900
Mother.

28:22.040 --> 28:22.970
Please sit down.

28:27.200 --> 28:28.250
Take Yimei

28:28.750 --> 28:29.480
and run away.

28:31.680 --> 28:32.050
Mother.

28:32.050 --> 28:32.960
We've already talked about this,
haven't we?

28:32.960 --> 28:34.290
I'm not going anywhere.

28:34.920 --> 28:35.510
If Yimei runs away,

28:35.510 --> 28:37.240
what do you expect Mr. Bai to do?

28:37.440 --> 28:38.110
If I run away,

28:38.110 --> 28:39.440
who will take care of you?

28:39.440 --> 28:41.160
We still have our tea plantation,

28:41.160 --> 28:42.420
and I promised Pingwen

28:42.480 --> 28:43.960
that I would teach him business.

28:43.960 --> 28:45.800
S-Sure, Pingyuan. I'll go.

28:46.310 --> 28:47.040
Go where?

28:47.070 --> 28:48.330
Where do you want to go?

28:49.200 --> 28:50.060
Fine, let's go.

28:50.440 --> 28:52.070
Take Mr. Bai and Mother with us,

28:52.070 --> 28:53.880
and our whole family will leave together.

28:53.880 --> 28:55.560
Why are you so stubborn?

28:56.550 --> 28:57.110
Mother.

28:58.000 --> 28:59.750
Didn't you ask about my thoughts?

28:59.750 --> 29:00.810
I do have a thought.

29:05.750 --> 29:07.150
Then go ahead and tell us.

29:08.270 --> 29:09.270
I've thought it through.

29:09.270 --> 29:09.810
I want to marry Yimei

29:09.810 --> 29:10.940
openly and proudly.

29:13.790 --> 29:16.450
Even though neither of our families
is wealthy,

29:16.510 --> 29:17.160
I'll make sure this wedding

29:17.160 --> 29:18.420
is properly arranged.

29:18.830 --> 29:20.490
I want the whole village to see

29:21.400 --> 29:22.330
that I am her man.

29:24.810 --> 29:26.210
I know that in this world,

29:26.750 --> 29:27.720
as long as Yimei understands me

29:27.720 --> 29:28.920
and I understand her,

29:28.920 --> 29:29.780
that's enough.

29:30.110 --> 29:32.040
What does it matter to anyone else?

29:32.720 --> 29:33.920
When it's time to harvest and roast tea,

29:33.920 --> 29:35.270
everyone will be busy working

29:35.270 --> 29:37.780
and won't have the time
to spread this kind of gossip.

29:37.780 --> 29:39.160
But if we run away,

29:39.960 --> 29:40.830
then we're practically

29:40.830 --> 29:42.270
confirming these rumors.

29:42.270 --> 29:42.720
They'll think

29:42.720 --> 29:43.640
we're guilty,

29:43.680 --> 29:44.440
that we're scared—

29:44.440 --> 29:46.210
that we fled
because we had something to hide.

29:46.210 --> 29:47.030
Who knows, they might even start saying
behind our backs

29:47.030 --> 29:49.030
that our whole family are traitors.

29:52.370 --> 29:54.100
We really were muddle‑headed.

29:55.160 --> 29:57.160
The two of us nearly harmed our kids.

29:59.720 --> 30:01.530
You always have a basketful of reasons.

30:01.530 --> 30:02.940
No one can outtalk you.

30:03.000 --> 30:05.060
Even if everything you said is right,

30:05.240 --> 30:05.940
how many years do Mr. Bai and I

30:05.940 --> 30:07.460
have left to live?

30:09.070 --> 30:11.130
What truly matters is that you and Yimei

30:11.130 --> 30:12.590
live a good life together.

30:13.160 --> 30:13.720
Mother,

30:14.590 --> 30:16.190
a good life for Yimei and me

30:16.550 --> 30:18.610
means taking good care of you

30:19.240 --> 30:20.700
and Mr. Bai at home.

30:21.270 --> 30:21.940
Mr. Bai,

30:22.640 --> 30:23.770
do you agree with me?

30:30.920 --> 30:31.960
Dear sis.

30:34.030 --> 30:35.310
In-law.

30:36.310 --> 30:37.120
This time,

30:37.440 --> 30:38.970
I won't be listening to you.

30:39.040 --> 30:39.680
Back when I taught him to read

30:39.680 --> 30:40.680
when he was a kid,

30:40.720 --> 30:41.270
I knew

30:41.310 --> 30:42.240
this child is strong-willed.

30:42.240 --> 30:43.750
No one could win an argument with him.

30:43.750 --> 30:44.350
Let's just

30:44.830 --> 30:46.510
listen to him.

30:46.680 --> 30:49.070
I'll go back and cheer Yimei up,

30:49.310 --> 30:51.250
and help her prepare her dowry.

30:52.750 --> 30:54.160
Sir, you're a wise man.

30:56.820 --> 30:57.550
Pingyuan.

31:11.680 --> 31:12.340
Pingwen.

31:12.550 --> 31:13.920
Come down the mountain with me

31:13.920 --> 31:15.450
to buy the betrothal gifts.

31:25.680 --> 31:27.680
This sedan chair is way too small.

31:28.160 --> 31:29.550
It might work for carrying a cat,

31:29.550 --> 31:30.950
but can it carry a person?

31:32.240 --> 31:33.960
Well, just for carrying the bride
for a little while,

31:33.960 --> 31:35.230
it'll do just fine.

31:35.400 --> 31:36.750
If it were to carry you, Sir,

31:36.750 --> 31:38.410
it definitely wouldn't work.

31:39.110 --> 31:40.570
Well, the two-bearer sedan chairs

31:40.570 --> 31:41.700
are just this small.

31:41.790 --> 31:42.960
If you have enough money,

31:42.960 --> 31:45.220
let's go check out the four-bearer ones.

31:59.750 --> 32:01.080
It truly is a bit bigger.

32:02.970 --> 32:03.790
But my money

32:03.790 --> 32:05.450
has been carefully budgeted:

32:05.790 --> 32:07.270
1 small two-bearer sedan chair,

32:07.270 --> 32:08.650
6 musicians, 2 attendants,

32:08.650 --> 32:09.350
2 matrons to escort the bride,

32:09.350 --> 32:10.070
2 matrons to receive her,

32:10.070 --> 32:10.750
and 12 tables for the banquet.

32:10.750 --> 32:11.720
Nothing can be missing.

32:11.720 --> 32:12.790
Don't mess this up for me.

32:12.790 --> 32:13.790
Rest assured, Sir.

32:13.790 --> 32:14.910
Our sedan chairs

32:14.960 --> 32:16.070
are in perfect condition.

32:16.070 --> 32:17.270
The bearers need to shave their heads.

32:17.270 --> 32:18.410
N-No problem.

32:18.750 --> 32:20.110
And their clothes have to be new.

32:20.110 --> 32:20.770
Certainly.

32:21.640 --> 32:23.440
Peace is just around the corner.

32:23.480 --> 32:24.610
How could I possibly

32:24.830 --> 32:26.700
overcharge you shamelessly?

32:31.480 --> 32:32.280
This one it is.

32:32.400 --> 32:33.060
No problem!

32:42.880 --> 32:44.210
The medicine got burnt.

33:25.070 --> 33:25.690
Sir,

33:25.850 --> 33:27.830
all the invitations have been sent out.

33:27.830 --> 33:28.400
I've also spoken with

33:28.400 --> 33:29.960
the cooks down the mountain.

33:29.960 --> 33:30.630
I think

33:30.790 --> 33:32.790
we should still keep things frugal.

33:33.960 --> 33:34.960
Yes, absolutely.

33:39.160 --> 33:41.200
Is she... Alright?

33:43.480 --> 33:44.510
She's perfectly healthy.

33:44.510 --> 33:45.640
Why wouldn't she be?

33:48.070 --> 33:49.360
She's just being shy.

33:49.550 --> 33:52.440
As a young girl, hearing things like this,
it's only natural.

33:52.440 --> 33:53.620
If this were in the past,
the moment you arrived,

33:53.620 --> 33:55.380
she would've come rushing out.

33:55.550 --> 33:56.590
But look at her now.

33:56.590 --> 33:58.590
She won't even bring you a cup of tea.

34:04.440 --> 34:05.820
Ask her to fill my cup.

34:49.840 --> 34:51.920
Mr. Bai asked me to get some water.

35:05.710 --> 35:06.960
That general Li...

35:09.070 --> 35:10.930
He didn't hit or scold you, did he?

35:13.280 --> 35:13.900
No.

35:17.190 --> 35:18.720
Why would he hit or scold me?

35:19.280 --> 35:20.740
He put you through so much.

35:21.070 --> 35:23.000
I get angry just thinking about it.

35:25.550 --> 35:27.010
What are you trying to say?

35:36.230 --> 35:36.760
Yimei.

35:37.550 --> 35:39.480
Do you have something on your mind?

35:39.550 --> 35:40.810
I don't know how to ask.

35:43.920 --> 35:44.630
I don't.

35:54.510 --> 35:55.640
Don't we...

35:56.150 --> 35:58.210
Have some unfinished conversation?

36:27.190 --> 36:28.590
Pingyuan, are you tired?

36:29.250 --> 36:31.380
Why don't you go back
and rest for a bit?

36:34.960 --> 36:36.880
You seem quite distracted these days.

36:36.880 --> 36:37.740
What happened?

36:47.230 --> 36:48.360
I just have a feeling

36:49.720 --> 36:51.050
that Yimei has changed.

36:53.000 --> 36:54.120
In my memory,

36:54.710 --> 36:56.110
Yimei hardly ever spoke.

36:57.030 --> 36:58.580
When she did say something,

36:58.800 --> 37:00.320
it was always soft and gentle,

37:00.320 --> 37:01.520
with a delicate tone.

37:02.320 --> 37:03.930
But now, she's become...

37:05.190 --> 37:06.120
Very assertive.

37:07.170 --> 37:08.320
The things she says

37:08.360 --> 37:09.960
seem logical on the surface,

37:10.230 --> 37:10.880
but when you think carefully,

37:10.880 --> 37:12.440
something's off about them,

37:12.440 --> 37:14.100
yet I can't seem to refute her.

37:16.880 --> 37:18.840
That's what happens
when someone's seen the world.

37:18.840 --> 37:20.070
Not to mention her—

37:20.110 --> 37:21.360
just take myself as an example.

37:21.360 --> 37:23.360
These days, I brag to everyone I meet

37:23.440 --> 37:25.070
that my brother and I
charged in and out of

37:25.070 --> 37:26.530
the military camp 7 times,

37:26.670 --> 37:27.970
no worse than Zhao Yun

37:28.070 --> 37:29.800
and even better than Zhang Fei.

37:30.030 --> 37:31.760
What nonsense you're talking.

37:32.920 --> 37:33.850
The key issue is,

37:34.550 --> 37:35.520
I just feel

37:35.760 --> 37:37.000
the way she talks to me now

37:37.000 --> 37:38.140
is too polite.

37:38.960 --> 37:40.070
What do you mean by too polite?

37:40.070 --> 37:41.110
She's just very courteous

37:41.110 --> 37:42.040
and very formal.

37:42.840 --> 37:44.600
I feel like I can't get close to her,

37:44.600 --> 37:46.530
like there's a barrier between us.

37:46.710 --> 37:48.770
Now you're just being unreasonable.

37:49.360 --> 37:51.150
You've been gone for so many years

37:51.150 --> 37:52.210
and just came back,

37:52.400 --> 37:52.840
and with such a major incident

37:52.840 --> 37:54.320
having just happened to her family—

37:54.320 --> 37:56.000
how close do you expect her
to be with you?

37:56.000 --> 37:57.060
It's not like that.

37:57.320 --> 37:58.360
We've known each other since childhood

37:58.360 --> 37:59.150
and grown up together.

37:59.150 --> 37:59.710
How could I not know

37:59.710 --> 38:00.590
what kind of person she is?

38:00.590 --> 38:01.790
Well, like last time,

38:02.070 --> 38:03.070
I risked my life

38:03.320 --> 38:04.710
to rescue her from the military camp.

38:04.710 --> 38:06.480
But as soon as she saw me,
she asked me to leave first,

38:06.480 --> 38:07.190
saying she wanted to stay

38:07.190 --> 38:08.840
and save those wounded soldiers.

38:08.840 --> 38:10.280
It's been even worse since she came back.

38:10.280 --> 38:11.480
The way she looks at me

38:11.840 --> 38:13.240
is like we're strangers.

38:14.590 --> 38:16.250
Well, not exactly strangers,

38:16.630 --> 38:17.190
just slightly better

38:17.190 --> 38:18.450
than total strangers.

38:29.760 --> 38:32.490
Now that Suzhou and Hangzhou
have been captured,

38:33.360 --> 38:34.230
I couldn't get any

38:34.230 --> 38:35.630
good silk fabrics at all.

38:36.110 --> 38:37.040
Those silk shops

38:37.070 --> 38:38.870
are only selling foreign stuff—

38:39.070 --> 38:40.590
they all looked like funeral clothes.

38:40.590 --> 38:41.860
I wandered around for two days

38:41.860 --> 38:43.260
and couldn't buy a thing.

38:43.760 --> 38:46.620
I only managed to get some silver jewelry
in the end.

38:48.590 --> 38:50.520
What about the wedding dress then?

38:52.110 --> 38:54.030
A girl needs a red wedding dress

38:54.440 --> 38:55.590
when she gets married

38:55.590 --> 38:56.760
no matter what.

38:59.110 --> 39:01.570
You can't have her wear
plain cloth, can you?

39:02.630 --> 39:04.440
Even if Mr. Bai agrees,

39:05.000 --> 39:05.980
Miss Bai

39:06.230 --> 39:07.880
would be furious with you.

39:09.100 --> 39:09.560
Mother.

39:10.400 --> 39:11.440
When you got married,

39:11.440 --> 39:13.300
could you afford a wedding dress?

39:25.280 --> 39:26.990
Speaking of my wedding dress,

39:32.320 --> 39:33.230
back then, there were hardly

39:33.230 --> 39:35.290
any villages that hadn't heard of it.

39:38.150 --> 39:40.070
It was made of fine Suzhou silk,

39:42.060 --> 39:43.660
and the buttons were coral.

39:45.680 --> 39:47.230
That red color was a bit deeper

39:47.230 --> 39:49.430
than the red of normal wedding dresses.

39:50.440 --> 39:52.400
The skirt I wore

39:53.070 --> 39:54.910
had Fushan longevity pattern,

39:54.960 --> 39:56.690
embroidered with sea monsters

39:58.320 --> 40:00.150
holding jewels in their hands,

40:02.510 --> 40:03.510
which were actually stitched

40:03.510 --> 40:05.590
with real gems.

40:06.760 --> 40:07.570
Mother,

40:07.670 --> 40:08.230
are you...

40:08.230 --> 40:10.340
You think I'm crazy

40:10.840 --> 40:12.700
and talking nonsense, don't you?

40:13.760 --> 40:15.130
No, of course not.

40:21.550 --> 40:23.080
Later, I found out

40:24.630 --> 40:25.590
that your father

40:26.150 --> 40:28.840
sold his collection of
paintings and calligraphy.

40:28.840 --> 40:30.110
He liked things to be

40:30.920 --> 40:32.180
dignified and lively,

40:32.590 --> 40:34.650
and he didn't want me to feel wronged.

40:41.110 --> 40:42.910
Father treated you really well.

40:46.670 --> 40:48.930
I'm not asking you to be like your father.

40:49.510 --> 40:51.310
I was young and naive back then.

40:51.840 --> 40:52.600
Actually,

40:53.880 --> 40:55.250
wearing a simple wedding dress

40:55.250 --> 40:56.450
would have been fine.

40:58.710 --> 41:00.230
Insisting on things we shouldn't have

41:00.230 --> 41:01.490
often brings trouble.

41:03.280 --> 41:04.010
That's true.

41:05.030 --> 41:06.200
Yimei isn't picky,

41:06.800 --> 41:08.930
so I think a plain cloth dress would do.

41:09.360 --> 41:10.080
Really?

41:14.320 --> 41:15.760
Don't look at me like that.

41:15.760 --> 41:16.360
It's true.

41:19.680 --> 41:21.220
But you have to ask her.

41:22.360 --> 41:24.290
No matter how much a girl likes you,

41:24.550 --> 41:25.880
if you can't even provide
a decent wedding dress

41:25.880 --> 41:26.950
for her to wear,

41:27.510 --> 41:30.110
and she doesn't even complain,
something must be off.

41:30.110 --> 41:31.920
It's not that she didn't complain.

41:31.920 --> 41:33.760
She... She just didn't say
anything at all.

41:33.760 --> 41:34.960
I think...

41:36.480 --> 41:38.400
If you ask me, getting married

41:38.630 --> 41:40.430
is the last thing on her mind now.

41:42.440 --> 41:43.480
Give it some time.

41:44.230 --> 41:46.660
Follow her lead and give it some time.

41:47.150 --> 41:48.150
But Mr. Bai's health

41:48.150 --> 41:49.030
is getting worse and worse.

41:49.030 --> 41:49.650
Son.

41:50.190 --> 41:52.630
Parents are only matters
for half a lifetime,

41:52.630 --> 41:54.630
but a spouse is for a whole lifetime.

41:55.460 --> 41:57.220
Don't try to make us happy.

41:58.230 --> 42:02.230
What truly matters is that the two of you
live a fulfilled life together.

42:13.710 --> 42:14.170
Father.

42:14.760 --> 42:16.290
Father, what are you doing?

42:21.320 --> 42:23.000
Dear, hold my legs.

42:23.030 --> 42:24.410
Hold my legs.

42:25.190 --> 42:26.920
Father, come down. I'll get it.

42:30.670 --> 42:31.330
Never mind.

42:32.150 --> 42:32.960
Help me down.

42:33.000 --> 42:33.440
Okay.

42:34.800 --> 42:36.360
I'm really useless.

42:43.760 --> 42:45.110
Father, what were you doing?

42:45.110 --> 42:46.920
If you need anything,
I can get it for you.

42:46.920 --> 42:48.360
You don't have the strength for that.

42:48.360 --> 42:48.840
Call the Gu brothers over

42:48.840 --> 42:50.560
in a bit

42:50.670 --> 42:52.200
and have them help me get it.

42:52.440 --> 42:53.650
All of these are the dowry

42:53.650 --> 42:54.990
I've been saving for you over the years.
